{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>On the first.</b> He took a abbreviated route, because he had mentioned at the beginning, \"The first month for you\" (Exodus [12:2]), and so the sense of בחדש הראשון is understood, and like it is בעשירי באחד לחדש (Genesis [7:10] — 'on the tenth, on the first of the month')."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:33:36.528195601Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}